        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: \"Happy Birthday to You\", \"Happy Birthday\", \"Good Morning to All\"\n- People: Patty Hill, Mildred J. Hill\n- Topics: birthday celebrations, song melody attribution\n\nFacts:\n- \"Happy Birthday to You\", commonly known as \"Happy Birthday\", is a celebratory song traditionally sung to celebrate the anniversary of a person's birth.\n- The melody of \"Happy Birthday to You\" comes from the song \"Good Morning to All\".\n- \"Good Morning to All\" has traditionally been attributed to the American sisters Patty Hill and Mildred J. Hill.\n- Mildred J. Hill was an American songwriter and musicologist.",
