        "original_id": "06d92b72-2f24-59a6-81be-440fb773e0aa",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Mildred J. Hill, Patty Hill\n- Songs: \"Happy Birthday to You\", \"Good Morning to All\"\n- Topics: melody attribution, disputed authorship\n\nFacts:\n- In 1893, the song \"Good Morning to All\" was traditionally attributed to American sisters Patty Hill and Mildred J. Hill.\n- The melody of \"Happy Birthday to You\" comes from the song \"Good Morning to All\".\n- The claim that Patty Hill and Mildred J. Hill composed the tune of \"Good Morning to All\" is disputed.\n- Mildred Jane Hill was born on June 27, 1859, and died on June 5, 1916.\n- Mildred Jane Hill was an American songwriter and musicologist.\n- Mildred Jane Hill composed the melody for \"Good Morning to All\", which was later used as the melody for \"Happy Birthday to You\".",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
